   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Put the centre at the origin. A and B}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{are ends of a diameter.}\\\\[5pt]&\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\vec a,\\;\\overrightarrow{OB}=-\\vec a,\\;\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\vec p\\\\[5pt]&|\\vec a|=|\\vec p|=r\\end{aligned}\\]",
